<title>INDIA: India produced 12,411 tonnes zinc in May.</title>
<headline>India produced 12,411 tonnes zinc in May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 12,411 tonnes of zinc in May against a target of 10,800 tonnes, a government statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>The country produced 24,323 tonnes of zinc during April and May 1997 compared with 18,439 tonnes in the same period in 1996, the statement said.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed    May, 1997	  Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity     ---------	 -------------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)	Actual	   Apr-May 97  Apr-May 96</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> HZL     152,000	 10,446	     21,037     15,250</p>
<p> BZL	30,000	  1,965		3,286	3,189</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Total   182,000	 12,411	     24,323     18,439</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
